      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Days later, UMBRA announces that the destruction of the facility was caused
    by an unexpected technical failure.


    No serious investigation follows.


    The
    public never learns about the experiments.


    They never learn about the children
    who were brought into the facility.


    And they never learn the truth about
    Chessica.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 362ea820d26982a489cdf7906095b7dc, type: 2}
