      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "HIT LAG\nA Sci-Fi Horror Game\nGAME DEVELOPMENT\n\nDang Tuan Linh\nLead
    Programmer\n\nGameplay Programming\nPlayer Systems\nInteraction Systems\nGame
    Systems & Integration\nEverythings\n\nNguyen Van Tung\n\nMap Design\nStory Planner\nPuzzle
    Design\nGame Concept & Ideas\n\nPham Thuy Ngan\n\nStory & Document\nPuzzle Design\nCharacter
    \n\nMENTOR\nNguyen Van Hieu\nNguyen Quang Minh\n\nProject Guidance\nGame Review\nTechnical
    Support\nBug Fixing & Optimization\n\nSPECIAL THANKS\n\nTo HIT club and mentors\nfor
    their guidance and support throughout development.\n\nTo our friends and testers\nwho
    played the game and helped us improve it.\n\nPOWERED BY\n\nUnity\n\nMUSIC & SOUND\n\nMusic
    and sound effects\nfrom licensed and royalty-free sources.\n\nHIT LAG\n\nEvery
    secret has a price."
