  m_text: 'The files reveal the truth.


    UMBRA had been secretly recruiting children
    who survived disasters and tragedies.


    They were promised protection, treatment,
    and a new life.


    Instead, they became test subjects.


    Their identities
    were erased.


    Their lives were reduced to numbers.


    And their suffering
    became data.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 362ea820d26982a489cdf7906095b7dc, type: 2}
